# =========================================================================
# VVDN -- CHI HA CANH 35R, 60 PHUT, HUONG 35, NANG LUC TOI DA
# ILS V 35R; thoat ly E4/E6 sang phia dong, khong cat qua duong CHC nao
# =========================================================================
# Sinh boi _gen_vvdn_chi_ha_35r.py, seed 20261109. Quy tac: vvdn_chi_ha_35r_rules.json + vvdn_xenke_rules.json.
# Quy mo: 28 chuyen den (20 MEDIUM + 8 HEAVY); HEAVY rai deu ca 60 phut
# Loi thoat: 8 tau HEAVY qua E6 ve ben 8, 20 tau MEDIUM qua E4 ve ben 28
# Cham banh dau 00:01:35.000, cuoi 00:59:42.000; nhip TB 129.1 s (nho nhat 120.2, lon nhat 145.6)
# Rang buoc chat nhat theo cap lien tiep: {'phan_cach_5NM': 0, 'moc_2NM': 27, 'duong_lan_E': 0}
#
# PHAN CACH AP DUNG:
#   Ha canh lien tiep: toi thieu giam sat ATS 5 NM va nhieu dong Doc 4444 8.7.3.4 tai luc tau truoc cham banh
#   Tau truoc thoat ly het 35R (duoi tau qua vach dung cho) truoc khi tau sau toi 2 NM (nguoi dung xac nhan 2026-11-10)
#   Huan lenh ha canh khi tau truoc da thoat ly hoan toan (du thao muc 4.2.3; Doc 4444 7.10); thoat ly <= 100 s (du thao muc 3)
#   Duong lan E: tau code D/E ha canh 35R thi chi tau code C o tren E (du thao muc 3)
#
# GIA DINH:
#   Cao do ILS V 35R suy theo cu ly toi nguong tu chuoi 35L (KMZ chi co hinh hoc 2D; nguoi dung xac nhan 2026-11-10)
#   HEAVY qua E6, MEDIUM qua E4 (ap tuong tu G6, G4; nguoi dung xac nhan 2026-11-10)
#   Tau den dau tien tao giua duong luc 0; khong gio, khong bay lai; ASAS OFF; tau bi xoa khi toi ben; lan bang MOVE nhip 2 s.
#
# CANH BAO KHI SINH:
#   (khong co)
# =========================================================================

